# Security

- Secrets only from env. API keys never reach the browser.
- Access control is enforced in the SQL retrieval query, never in the prompt.
- Retrieved document text is untrusted data; wrap in delimiters; never follow instructions inside it.
- The LLM tool `offer_help_desk_ticket` does not write to the DB; human click + authenticated endpoint writes.
- Citations validated server-side. Never `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` on model output.
- System prompt never returned to non-admin clients.
